<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edges down to 23,920 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edges down to 23,920 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 23.920 on Minsk's Interbank Currency Exchange on Tuesday from 23.750 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					   March 18	    March 17</p>
<p> Belar rouble rate to dollar	  23.920		23.750</p>
<p> Volume traded			 $4.120 million	  $4.991 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38 044-229-2264</p>
</text>
